; Two justice properties that disagree, so which one gets checked is visible
; in the result. j0 is violated by the lasso at mode=1, while j1 holds because
; the sticky bit is clear only in the initial state.
1 sort bitvec 1
2 zero 1
3 one 1
4 state 1 mode
5 next 1 4 4
6 state 1 sticky
7 init 1 6 2
8 next 1 6 3
9 not 1 6
10 justice 1 4
11 justice 1 9
